We break the string virtually using the indices `si` and `ei`. Consider the example `abcde`, with `si` at `a` and `ei` at `e`.

```java
int LPSSRec(String Str, int si, int ei) {
    if (si > ei) return 0;
    if (si == ei) return 1;
    int ans = 0;
    if (Str[si] == Str[ei]) {
        ans = LPSSRec(Str, si + 1, ei - 1) + 2;
    } else {
        int O1 = LPSSRec(Str, si + 1, ei);
        int O2 = LPSSRec(Str, si, ei - 1);
        ans = max(O1, O2);
    }
    return ans;
}
```

